Spec: Formatters

Purpose:
  Locale-aware text for durations, ride dates, day keys, history day labels and distances.

Owns:
  ./formatters.dart
  /test/domain/formatters_test.dart
  /test/domain/date_label_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/04-domain.md
  /docs/specs/history/17-follow-route.md

Must:
  Durations show `H:MM:SS` from one hour on, else `MM:SS`.
  Ride dates show `dd.MM.yyyy  HH:mm` and ride times `HH:mm`; a missing time shows `—`.
  Day keys are `yyyy-MM-dd`; a missing time gives `0000-00-00`.
  History day labels read today, yesterday or a localized `yMMMMd` date that always includes the year;
    an unparsable key falls back to the key itself.
  The distance to a route shows whole metres below 1 km and `X.XX km` from there on.
  An elevation shows whole metres with the unit, `123 m`, never switches to km, and reads `-- m` without a
    value (#97).
  Localized words such as today and yesterday are passed in by the caller.

Example:
  `3599` s: `59:59`
  `3600` s: `1:00:00`
